{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/07/2026QN4cdDhpxP1785228689.jpeg\"/><p style=\"text-align: left;\">「何伯」何煊驚傳病逝，終年 79 歲。據報道，何伯於昨日中午 12 時 30 分在醫院安詳離世。</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"f111cb10-a30e-44b7-bdf7-ca40da35.png\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/07/2026H5w55RPviV1785225261.png\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"f111cb10-a30e-44b7-bdf7-ca40da35.png\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: left;\">消息指，何伯早前曾接受小腸氣手術，至 6 月 5 日發現肝硬化，並同時驗出「肝位置有好多癌細胞」。當時醫生已告知其病情不樂觀，估計僅餘「幾日至一個月命」。</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"螢幕截圖 2026-07-28 下午3.54.53.png\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/07/2026B23YQ7nOMY1785225310.png\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"螢幕截圖 2026-07-28 下午3.54.53.png\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><p class=\"p2\" style=\"text-align: left;\">據悉，何伯離世時過程安詳，「冇入 ICU，亦都冇插過喉，佢係瞓住咁走」。此外，有傳在何伯臨終之際，早前曾與他反面的子女亦有到醫院見父親最後一面。據了解，在何伯離世前兩日，曾有牧師前往醫院為他進行洗禮。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-28T08:59:58.145012+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":227,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}